WEBVTT

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:11.240
...and she rode solo to the highest point
of the national highway!

00:00:11.240 --> 00:00:14.320
I was really surprised!

00:00:14.680 --> 00:00:16.630
Ah, you mean Shibu Pass?

00:00:16.630 --> 00:00:20.550
It's a famous touring destination, but yeah, it's amazing.

00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:25.540
She looked like she was a
college student or a young office lady!

00:00:25.850 --> 00:00:27.800
She seemed like a cool, open-hearted person.

00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:28.700
Yeah!

00:00:31.170 --> 00:00:35.780
And she let me touch her road bike!

00:00:35.780 --> 00:00:37.860
It was so light!

00:00:37.860 --> 00:00:40.180
I wonder what it's like to ride one!

00:00:40.180 --> 00:00:44.270
Hmm, what's that, Ami?
Are you taking an interest in road bikes now?

00:00:44.270 --> 00:00:47.050
Huh? Um, just a little...

00:00:47.050 --> 00:00:49.570
I think that's great.

00:00:49.570 --> 00:00:52.820
Oh, but, I have Ponta-kun, so...

00:00:52.820 --> 00:00:56.060
There's nothing wrong with getting another one.

00:00:56.910 --> 00:00:58.580
It's just how you use it.

00:00:59.080 --> 00:01:01.580
How I use it?

00:01:01.580 --> 00:01:05.580
Having one with a basket is convenient for shopping.

00:01:05.580 --> 00:01:10.090
A folding bike is great if you need to move around at a destination.

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:13.590
A mountain bike is made for peddling on mountain paths.

00:01:13.590 --> 00:01:17.230
And for fast and easy cycling,
there's nothing like a road bike.

00:01:18.930 --> 00:01:22.230
It's only natural to use a bike that suits your needs, right?

00:01:23.050 --> 00:01:27.220
I see... I never thought of it that way.

00:03:05.490 --> 00:03:08.320
Use it to suit my needs.

00:03:10.020 --> 00:03:15.760
Whether you buy one or not,
it can't hurt to take a look.

00:03:16.310 --> 00:03:22.010
We're going to Paca-san's store this weekend.
Would you like to come along?

00:03:26.850 --> 00:03:29.540
Yes, I'll be right there!

00:03:40.080 --> 00:03:41.980
I'm so sorry!

00:03:54.590 --> 00:03:57.260
A bicycle other than Ponta-kun...

00:04:00.130 --> 00:04:05.640
Just like Hinako-san said,
there are all kinds of bikes.

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:10.140
But I have Ponta-kun...

00:04:10.140 --> 00:04:15.150
But... I can't forget that
cool road bike I saw at Shibu Pass.

00:04:16.120 --> 00:04:18.980
Onee-chan, what are you mumbling about?

00:04:20.340 --> 00:04:22.150
Cycling again?

00:04:22.640 --> 00:04:25.290
You're really hooked on it these days.

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:26.600
I guess...

00:04:31.490 --> 00:04:33.410
Welcome-paca!

00:04:33.930 --> 00:04:36.330
Right now, in that corner...

00:04:36.330 --> 00:04:40.190
we're having a super clearance sale-paca!

00:04:58.230 --> 00:04:59.690
It's white...

00:05:00.590 --> 00:05:02.130
and beautiful...

00:05:02.650 --> 00:05:04.200
So cool!

00:05:05.530 --> 00:05:07.620
And yet, it's cheap!

00:05:07.620 --> 00:05:11.580
I just mean compared to the rest.
It's certainly not cheap.

00:05:12.130 --> 00:05:14.370
Why is it so low?

00:05:14.370 --> 00:05:17.640
It's on sale because it's an old model-paca.

00:05:17.640 --> 00:05:19.960
But it performs flawlessly-paca.

00:05:19.960 --> 00:05:22.960
Oh yeah, this is a great bargain.

00:05:22.960 --> 00:05:25.970
I think it's the perfect size for you too, Ami-chan.

00:05:28.350 --> 00:05:32.750
Um... My next pay check is...

00:05:32.750 --> 00:05:37.080
Plus what I have left from my last paycheck...

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:40.560
Huh...? I might actually be able to afford this.

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:46.990
But is it really okay for me to buy it?

00:05:47.650 --> 00:05:50.000
I just bought cycling shorts and other accessories...

00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:54.000
so I won't have any money this month, or even next month!

00:05:54.000 --> 00:05:56.870
I can afford it, but...

00:05:58.030 --> 00:05:59.500
But, but...!

00:06:01.100 --> 00:06:04.030
What do you think, Aoi-chan?

00:06:04.760 --> 00:06:08.710
You said you own a road bike too, right?

00:06:08.710 --> 00:06:10.260
Well, yeah.

00:06:10.260 --> 00:06:13.860
It's really different from the cross bike I usually ride.

00:06:13.860 --> 00:06:15.020
Yes, yes!

00:06:15.020 --> 00:06:18.320
So it really is different, huh?

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:24.280
Oh, but...

00:06:24.280 --> 00:06:27.430
Since you're a friend of a special customer...

00:06:27.430 --> 00:06:29.490
If you put down a deposit,

00:06:29.490 --> 00:06:33.830
you can put it on layaway until next month-paca!

00:06:35.230 --> 00:06:37.330
How's that for service-paca?

00:06:37.330 --> 00:06:39.380
With that road bike...

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:40.330
Huh?

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:45.290
Entering a brevet or flèche
might not be just a dream for you.

00:06:45.790 --> 00:06:47.550
Huh? A brevet?

00:06:48.420 --> 00:06:52.670
And it's held in regions throughout Japan,
so you get to try all kinds of delicious food.

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:55.080
A flèche...

00:06:55.080 --> 00:06:59.500
It's a wonderful form of cycling where you can
share moving experiences with your teammates.

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:05.010
But once you get your hands on a road bike,
you might be able to see a brand new world.

00:07:08.110 --> 00:07:09.780
I think with this bike...

00:07:09.780 --> 00:07:14.750
my world will expand even more.

00:07:15.730 --> 00:07:18.660
I'm... going to buy this!

00:07:18.660 --> 00:07:20.160
Yes!

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:22.790
Thank you for shopping-paca!

00:07:22.790 --> 00:07:25.360
Now you own a road bike too, Ami!

00:07:25.360 --> 00:07:27.490
We welcome you!

00:07:27.490 --> 00:07:32.080
It's the first time I've spent so much money,
my knees are shaking!

00:07:33.050 --> 00:07:36.020
Oh, but this bike...

00:07:36.020 --> 00:07:40.320
Ah, people use different pedals, so...

00:07:40.320 --> 00:07:41.810
they're sold separately-paca.

00:07:41.810 --> 00:07:42.800
What?!

00:07:42.800 --> 00:07:43.810
There's also...

00:07:43.810 --> 00:07:48.640
Front and back lights, bottle holders, cycle computers...

00:07:48.640 --> 00:07:51.630
All this equipment can add up.

00:07:51.630 --> 00:07:52.950
Yes, yes.

00:07:57.040 --> 00:07:58.950
Welcome!

00:07:59.470 --> 00:08:01.130
Please take your time.

00:08:01.730 --> 00:08:05.050
Kurata-san, you can take a break.

00:08:05.050 --> 00:08:07.130
Oh, thank you!

00:08:13.920 --> 00:08:15.140
Good work out there.

00:08:15.540 --> 00:08:17.750
Ah, you too.

00:08:17.750 --> 00:08:20.400
Ami-chan, is that a cycling book?

00:08:20.400 --> 00:08:23.390
Yes, I just started recently.

00:08:23.390 --> 00:08:27.040
Oh, with this fast one with the thin tires?

00:08:27.040 --> 00:08:29.280
Yes, it's a road bike.

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:31.790
Oh, that's quite unexpected.

00:08:31.790 --> 00:08:33.780
Is it?

00:08:33.780 --> 00:08:36.570
I mean, you're probably falling over a lot...

00:08:36.570 --> 00:08:40.160
Chihaya-chan, that's mean! It's not like that!

00:08:41.350 --> 00:08:42.820
Sorry, sorry.

00:08:42.820 --> 00:08:46.920
But cycling can get really expensive.

00:08:48.720 --> 00:08:51.670
Really? Then I know just the thing!

00:08:52.370 --> 00:08:53.190
Huh?

00:09:02.180 --> 00:09:04.870
Ami-chan, you seem tired.

00:09:04.870 --> 00:09:07.180
Oh, I'm fine.

00:09:08.190 --> 00:09:12.290
You're working multiple part-time jobs, right?
Are you sure you can handle it?

00:09:12.290 --> 00:09:15.360
Yup, I think I can manage somehow.

00:09:15.950 --> 00:09:17.700
What kind of job is it?

00:09:17.700 --> 00:09:20.310
Huh? Well...

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:25.320
It's not so different from what I do now. Serve coffee and...

00:09:25.320 --> 00:09:26.940
Like a café?

00:09:27.960 --> 00:09:31.340
Oh, yes... sort of like that.

00:09:32.170 --> 00:09:36.300
By the way, how do you all pay
for your bike parts and stuff?

00:09:36.300 --> 00:09:39.970
I tutor my relative's child.

00:09:39.970 --> 00:09:43.900
I help with the office work at my father's business.

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:47.910
More like takes care of the books.

00:09:49.100 --> 00:09:53.240
Yayoi-san, I can see you doing that.
You've really got it together.

00:09:53.240 --> 00:09:54.100
Yeah...

00:09:54.650 --> 00:09:57.310
Hinako-san, what do you do?

00:09:57.860 --> 00:10:01.660
I... I help out at home.

00:10:01.660 --> 00:10:02.400
Right?

00:10:02.400 --> 00:10:03.530
I guess so.

00:10:06.250 --> 00:10:08.620
Oh, time to go to work.

00:10:09.470 --> 00:10:11.250
See you!

00:10:14.630 --> 00:10:18.460
Help out at home? What does she do?

00:10:18.460 --> 00:10:20.140
Want to know?

00:10:24.640 --> 00:10:26.390
Oh man...!

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:35.390
Ah, Hinako-chan, you look as cute as always today!

00:10:35.390 --> 00:10:36.870
For sure!

00:10:36.870 --> 00:10:38.400
Ah, man...

00:10:38.780 --> 00:10:41.780
Why is my uniform a Chinese dress?

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:45.910
Well, that's because we run a Chinese restaurant.

00:10:47.910 --> 00:10:52.250
Still, this doesn't work on me!
I don't look good in this.

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:54.800
Oh, you look great. Right?

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:56.730
It looks great on you!

00:10:56.730 --> 00:10:58.730
You're the best, Hinako-chan.

00:11:00.460 --> 00:11:02.930
It irritates me to say this myself, but...

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:08.390
this kind of outfit should be worn by someone with a better figure...

00:11:09.770 --> 00:11:12.680
On someone like me...

00:11:16.440 --> 00:11:18.920
Yup, you look great, Hinako-chan.

00:11:18.920 --> 00:11:22.720
A Chinese dress on a girl
who looks like a grade schooler...

00:11:22.720 --> 00:11:23.930
I can't get enough.

00:11:26.700 --> 00:11:27.430
Who's in...

00:11:27.430 --> 00:11:29.080
grade school?!

00:11:29.400 --> 00:11:31.120
Thank you.

00:11:31.120 --> 00:11:32.580
What a wonderful treat.

00:11:32.990 --> 00:11:34.980
That looks nice! I want some of that!

00:11:34.980 --> 00:11:35.630
Me too!

00:11:37.000 --> 00:11:38.420
Shut up!

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:40.100
Thanks!

00:11:40.100 --> 00:11:41.140
That was great!

00:11:42.460 --> 00:11:43.840
Sheesh!

00:11:43.840 --> 00:11:46.370
We only get weirdos for customers!

00:11:49.100 --> 00:11:55.100
But with my next paycheck,
I'll have a full set of high-end components.

00:11:55.100 --> 00:11:59.610
Or should I save up a little more
and go with a set of electric components?

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:04.430
If I go electric, I can link the newest GPS!

00:12:05.430 --> 00:12:09.910
Sometimes Hinako-chan murmurs things that go over my head.

00:12:09.910 --> 00:12:12.250
That's another thing that makes her special.

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:15.080
Welcome!

00:12:18.340 --> 00:12:20.590
What are you guys doing here?!

00:12:21.580 --> 00:12:23.310
Hinako-san, you look so cute!

00:12:24.070 --> 00:12:27.060
Amazing!
It's Hinako-san in a Chinese dress!!

00:12:27.060 --> 00:12:29.310
Can I take a picture?

00:12:29.310 --> 00:12:31.500
Please! Please let me take your picture!

00:12:31.500 --> 00:12:33.640
What? Ah- Wait!

00:12:33.640 --> 00:12:35.780
No! Absolutely not!

00:12:35.780 --> 00:12:37.650
Huh? Why not?

00:12:38.160 --> 00:12:43.050
I mean, this doesn't look good on me in the first place...

00:12:43.050 --> 00:12:44.860
It's embarrassing, so stop it.

00:12:46.300 --> 00:12:48.030
Hinako-san, you are too cute!

00:12:48.030 --> 00:12:50.740
Can you give us that same expression again?

00:12:50.740 --> 00:12:54.320
Hey, quiet! Go home, you guys!

00:12:54.320 --> 00:12:57.770
Why'd you bring them here, Yayoi?!

00:12:58.750 --> 00:13:03.030
Oh, your friends are visiting. Perfect timing.

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:04.130
Why?!

00:13:04.590 --> 00:13:07.760
You keep saying how you hate wearing a Chinese dress,

00:13:07.760 --> 00:13:10.660
so I ordered a new uniform.

00:13:10.660 --> 00:13:12.660
A new one?

00:13:12.660 --> 00:13:14.520
How about this?

00:13:17.170 --> 00:13:19.200
A bunny outfit!

00:13:19.200 --> 00:13:20.610
Yes! A bunny!

00:13:20.610 --> 00:13:22.360
Hinako-chan's bunny outfit!

00:13:22.360 --> 00:13:24.100
I'd like to see you in it.

00:13:24.100 --> 00:13:25.110
Yes!

00:13:28.870 --> 00:13:30.800
Like I'll wear that thing!

00:13:34.870 --> 00:13:39.440
Those parents of mine! Give me a break!

00:13:39.440 --> 00:13:41.750
Oh, what's wrong with it? You look cute.

00:13:41.750 --> 00:13:45.770
But it's sort of embarrassing, isn't it?

00:13:45.770 --> 00:13:49.430
Well, I get paid well...

00:13:49.430 --> 00:13:51.510
for looking like this.

00:13:51.510 --> 00:13:56.830
I have a ton of things I want.
I have no choice but to wear this.

00:13:56.830 --> 00:13:57.850
Right?

00:13:57.850 --> 00:14:01.970
It's embarrassing, but the pay is good,
so you have no choice.

00:14:01.970 --> 00:14:04.110
Tell me about it.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:07.050
I'm going to do my best too.

00:14:07.050 --> 00:14:09.690
Since the pay's good...

00:14:13.730 --> 00:14:17.470
Ami, what kind of job did you take on?

00:14:17.470 --> 00:14:19.580
You mentioned a café, but...

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:25.010
I hope it's not something indecent
that you can't be open about!

00:14:28.700 --> 00:14:30.140
Mister...

00:14:32.110 --> 00:14:35.350
How about... another....

00:14:35.350 --> 00:14:36.140
drink...?

00:14:36.970 --> 00:14:41.270
No way... Calm down.
Ami would never...

00:14:41.270 --> 00:14:45.610
But this is Ami... She's easily fooled... It's possible!

00:14:46.900 --> 00:14:49.360
Now I'm getting really worried!

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:56.370
I see... Ami's been acting strangely lately?

00:14:56.370 --> 00:15:00.450
Yes... She's definitely been acting suspiciously.

00:15:00.450 --> 00:15:04.130
Even if I ask her, she won't tell me what her part-time job is.

00:15:04.130 --> 00:15:08.700
Ami was definitely strange the last time.

00:15:08.700 --> 00:15:11.010
Isn't it a café?

00:15:11.010 --> 00:15:13.580
I'm not certain about that.

00:15:13.580 --> 00:15:17.270
I'm worried that she's gotten herself into some trouble.

00:15:17.270 --> 00:15:21.420
Ami-chan's not good at turning people down.

00:15:21.420 --> 00:15:24.900
Exactly! That's why I'm so worried sick...

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:26.120
I see...

00:15:26.120 --> 00:15:28.060
Then there's just one thing to do...

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:31.820
We tail her!

00:15:33.100 --> 00:15:35.530
I don't think that's a good idea...

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:38.420
But you still came to my shop!

00:15:39.300 --> 00:15:43.440
Ami-chan won't talk even if you ask her, right?

00:15:43.440 --> 00:15:44.400
That's right.

00:15:44.400 --> 00:15:48.840
And she could be caught up in a bad situation, right?

00:15:50.060 --> 00:15:52.430
That's worrisome.

00:15:56.610 --> 00:15:58.060
Okay.

00:15:59.160 --> 00:16:00.330
Let's tail her!

00:16:01.310 --> 00:16:05.310
If Ami's in trouble...

00:16:05.310 --> 00:16:07.870
I'll do everything in my power to help her!

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.750
Are you sure this is the place?

00:16:22.750 --> 00:16:27.500
There's no mistake.
I saw Ami come in here.

00:16:31.510 --> 00:16:34.240
This seems like a family restaurant.

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:35.410
Yes.

00:16:35.410 --> 00:16:38.700
All the waitresses are in maid outfits.

00:16:38.700 --> 00:16:40.140
So cute.

00:16:43.820 --> 00:16:44.600
Ami!

00:16:44.600 --> 00:16:45.930
There she is.

00:16:45.930 --> 00:16:48.520
Ami-chan looks so cute.

00:16:50.020 --> 00:16:56.460
The skirt is so long and billowy,
I'm scared I'm going to trip on it at any minute.

00:16:56.460 --> 00:16:57.780
I have to be careful.

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:03.420
Oww...

00:17:04.120 --> 00:17:08.250
I'm so sorry! I'll bring you a new drink right away!

00:17:08.640 --> 00:17:10.230
Oh my...

00:17:10.230 --> 00:17:15.970
She's not in trouble,
she's making trouble.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:17.510
Ami...

00:17:20.430 --> 00:17:23.770
I might get fired if I keep messing up like this...

00:17:31.960 --> 00:17:34.010
The manager is looking at me!

00:17:36.180 --> 00:17:39.200
Kurata-san, can I speak with you for a moment?

00:17:39.200 --> 00:17:40.160
Y-Yes!

00:17:42.060 --> 00:17:44.830
I-I'm sorry I keep making mistakes.

00:17:47.930 --> 00:17:51.850
You have all the qualities of a clumsy maid!

00:17:51.850 --> 00:17:52.800
Pardon?

00:17:53.340 --> 00:17:57.560
Keep doing just that and grasp the customers' hearts.

00:17:57.560 --> 00:17:59.400
O-Okay, I'll do my best...

00:17:59.740 --> 00:18:03.230
Here, I'll take care of this.
You go back to the floor.

00:18:03.230 --> 00:18:04.430
Yes.

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:08.810
Okay, this time for sure...
Be very careful.

00:18:09.360 --> 00:18:13.340
Here is your hot caffè latte.

00:18:13.340 --> 00:18:15.670
Can you do the usual thing again?

00:18:15.670 --> 00:18:16.800
Yes!

00:18:16.800 --> 00:18:20.590
O-Of course, I'm now going to cast
a spell on it to make it taste better...

00:18:20.590 --> 00:18:22.140
Here I go...

00:18:23.560 --> 00:18:27.410
Tastier... Tastier...

00:18:27.410 --> 00:18:31.880
May Ami's love reach you!

00:18:32.300 --> 00:18:34.380
Kyaru~~~n!

00:18:38.020 --> 00:18:40.260
Th-This is...

00:18:40.260 --> 00:18:41.640
Oh my...

00:18:41.640 --> 00:18:45.440
And next, both of us together...

00:18:45.440 --> 00:18:48.440
P-Please, let us cast the spell together as one.

00:18:48.440 --> 00:18:49.900
Okay.

00:18:49.900 --> 00:18:55.420
Please make a heart shape close to
your chest and chant, "tastier."

00:18:55.420 --> 00:18:57.100
Here we go!

00:18:57.100 --> 00:18:58.200
Yes!

00:18:58.200 --> 00:19:03.030
Tastier... Tastier...

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:05.540
Kyaru~ru~ru~ru~n!

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:08.730
Um... This is really...

00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:13.680
Yes, it's the kind of thing you'd want to hide at all costs.

00:19:13.680 --> 00:19:18.300
Really? Aoi-chan,
I think you'd look great in a maid outfit.

00:19:19.360 --> 00:19:22.140
Ami-chan, you're so cute when you blush.

00:19:22.140 --> 00:19:25.000
I'd like the Blushing option too!

00:19:25.000 --> 00:19:27.400
What? Is that a new service?

00:19:27.400 --> 00:19:29.350
Wait, that's not what I meant to...

00:19:29.350 --> 00:19:32.350
Okay, I want to Blushing option too!

00:19:32.350 --> 00:19:33.060
Me too!

00:19:33.060 --> 00:19:34.610
Me too, please!

00:19:36.050 --> 00:19:37.110
I...

00:19:39.630 --> 00:19:41.630
This will sell!

00:19:41.630 --> 00:19:45.990
Kurata-san, I'm adding
the Blushing option to our menu!

00:19:48.430 --> 00:19:50.240
Order up!

00:19:50.240 --> 00:19:52.910
Ami sure is popular.

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:57.000
She is! You must be relieved, Aoi-chan.

00:19:57.000 --> 00:19:59.880
Should I be relieved?

00:20:00.820 --> 00:20:05.520
But, it's not like she's caught up in anything bad.

00:20:05.520 --> 00:20:09.530
Hinako-san, Yayoi-san, thank you.

00:20:09.530 --> 00:20:11.600
Shall we leave?

00:20:11.600 --> 00:20:13.790
Hold on, Aoi.

00:20:13.790 --> 00:20:16.110
Ami's working hard,

00:20:16.110 --> 00:20:20.590
don't you think we should
contribute to the store's sales?

00:20:23.490 --> 00:20:24.740
Good idea.

00:20:24.740 --> 00:20:27.990
After all, we've come all the way to a store like this.

00:20:27.990 --> 00:20:29.730
Are you serious?

00:20:29.730 --> 00:20:31.870
Maid-san, over here!

00:20:31.870 --> 00:20:34.000
Over here too!

00:20:39.770 --> 00:20:42.220
Wh-Why are you all here?!

00:20:42.640 --> 00:20:47.860
Ami-chan, we'll have the Blushing Option plus a two-shot Polaroid with you.

00:20:47.860 --> 00:20:50.220
Sounds great, that'll make a nice souvenir.

00:20:51.560 --> 00:20:54.160
What? I have to do that in front of everyone?

00:20:56.300 --> 00:20:57.900
Are you two...

00:20:57.900 --> 00:20:59.470
...demons?

00:21:07.650 --> 00:21:09.680
Sorry about today.

00:21:09.680 --> 00:21:12.280
I should hope so! That was mean.

00:21:12.280 --> 00:21:15.870
I was so embarrassed, I almost died.

00:21:15.870 --> 00:21:19.180
I'm so sorry. But I was worried.

00:21:19.180 --> 00:21:21.620
Next time, I'll treat.

00:21:21.620 --> 00:21:23.060
Really?

00:21:26.040 --> 00:21:30.540
That job pays really well.
It's way better than the family restaurant.

00:21:30.540 --> 00:21:31.520
Is that so?

00:21:32.740 --> 00:21:36.090
Your road bike's delivery date is next month isn't it?

00:21:36.090 --> 00:21:37.520
Work hard.

00:21:39.460 --> 00:21:43.580
I'll do just that and save up money for my road bike!

00:21:43.580 --> 00:21:44.900
Yeah.

00:21:45.550 --> 00:21:48.910
Ponta-kun, let's work hard tomorrow too.

00:23:30.940 --> 00:23:35.720
I was really surprised when Aoi-chan and the others showed up at the maid cafe where I work!

00:23:35.720 --> 00:23:37.770
It was so embarrassing...

00:23:37.770 --> 00:23:40.810
But this is all for my new road bike!

00:23:40.810 --> 00:23:44.510
Next time on Long Riders: "A Changing World"
